    hintEn:
        'On for owners and managers: Cash spot shows the full live till report (expected cash, every payment method, all figures) and prints it, and the expected figures show before closing. Without it a person counts blind at close and sees the report after closing; someone holding it can unlock one look with their PIN. Every look is recorded.',
